  "_comment": [
    "Pinned upstream inputs. 'commit', 'sha256' and 'bytes' are written by `gbg fetch --update`;",
    "everything else is curated. Each component maps upstream field names (TSV columns / XML",
    "attributes) to a license. A component whose license is not open is DECLARED here so its",
    "fields are excluded at parse time -- see gbg/licenses.py and docs/DESIGN.md.",
    "openbible-topics is VENDORED (local_dir): upstream regenerates it weekly with no version",
    "history, so a dated snapshot is committed and its 'commit' is the snapshot date."
  ],
